    "description": {
      "en": "$tscersi_rate is the employer sickness-insurance contribution rate applicable to higher earners since 2019 (income above 2.5 SMIC through 2024, redefined as above 2.25 SMIC from 2025). Its value (13%) matches contributions.md's 'Employer Health Insurance' row. It is used in tscer_fr/ArithOp ('Sickness insurance contributions') and tscer_fr/BenCalc (Comp_perTU)."
